{"id": "world-1", "headline": "Rep. Gomez to resign after House Ethics report", "source": "NPR", "url": "https://www.npr.org/2026/11/23/g-s1-155142/california-democrat-rep-gomez-resigns-following-ethics-report-on-sexual-misconduct-allegations", "published": "2026-11-23", "url_verified": true, "pages": ["Rep. Jimmy Gomez, a California Democrat, said Monday he will resign from Congress effective Dec. 1. The announcement followed a bipartisan House Ethics Committee report released the same day. The panel found substantial evidence that Gomez made unwelcome sexual advances toward a House staffer and disregarded the power imbalance in his position. The report said the conduct could constitute criminal sexual assault. Gomez has served since 2017 and lost reelection this fall to fellow Democrat Angela Gonzales-Torres. He said he cooperated but disagrees with the report and objected to the process, saying his testimony was selectively quoted.", "Attorneys for the unnamed staffer said she testified truthfully and at personal risk. The resignation ends a probe the committee opened in August. Source: NPR."], "qr": {"n": 45, "rows": ["111111101011001111001110011011110000101111111", "100000100110100101000101100001011101001000001", "101110100001101111001011010001011101001011101", "101110100000011001100001010110011101101011101", "101110100110000001011111111001110011101011101", "100000100001111100001000101001011100001000001", "111111101010101010101010101010101010101111111", "000000001110110100001000101110100100100000000", "110110100011001111111111110111010000001000001", "001010000110001101010010001110110011101101010", "010000111100010111100110110001010111000000111", "000011001101010100010110100000001011111000100", "011100100011001100101100000010101001010011001", "011100011101110101010110001101101001101100110", "001100111011110010111111111001001101111100110", "110010001111111101011110001101000100010101110", "000000100100001001111110100100001010000000001", "11110001010001001111010100